# _Power from the sun....._

Since the beginning of 2013 Rhythm Culture purchased an off-grid stand alone Solar system.  Ever since we have been 100% solar powered! For our set-up we purchased:  1 x 1000 watt inverter, 1 x 230watt panel and 2 x 280Ah batteries. Now that's something to be excited about! How many businesses out there are running on solar?  Whats your set-up? We intend to expand over the next few months...Power from the sun is awesome! :)
